    {
      "id": "2070262962820980870",
      "text": "This figma motion reminds me of the early days of learning auto layout and figma pen tool then.\n\nIt was hard initial but once you understand the setttings and how to use it effectively? it becomes simple and and fun to use\n\nYou just have to give it time and keep trying.",
      "author": {
        "id": "1280071760700936192",
