        "text": "Thank you @figma for the introduction of figma motion \n\nI am about to explore every bit of it💃💃💃.\n\nAdobe After effect has been making me reflect if I still want to do motion😂😂 but you just raised the bar so high for us designers.\n\nThank you!",
