    {
      "id": "2070122539054186949",
      "text": "You’re still designing UI animations the slow way 😬\n\n@Figma Motion brings the timeline inside your design file:\n\n✅ Keyframes\n✅ Easing curves\n✅ Spring presets\n✅ Animated components\n✅ AI prompts for motion\n✅ Dev Mode export for CSS, JSON, React\nMotion is no longer a “handoff problem.”\n\nIt’s becoming part of the design system.\n\nI wrote a full guide here 👇\nhttps://t.co/JljGgTOH3k\n\n#Figma #UIDesign #MotionDesign #ProductDesign #DesignSystems #AI",
